{"slug":"n-z-e","ar":"ن ز ع","total":20,"core":"pulling out; disputing","forms":[{"ar":"نَزَعَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":10,"gloss":"to draw out; to take away, remove","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":108,"p":1,"ar":["وَنَزَعَ","يَدَهُۥ","فَإِذَا","هِىَ","بَيْضَآءُ","لِلنَّـٰظِرِينَ"],"en":"And he drew out his hand; thereupon it was white [with radiance] for the observers"}},{"ar":"تَنَٰزَعُ","kind":"verb","form":6,"count":7,"gloss":"to dispute with one another","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":62,"p":1,"ar":["فَتَنَـٰزَعُوٓا۟","أَمْرَهُم","بَيْنَهُمْ","وَأَسَرُّوا۟","ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ"],"en":"So they disputed over their affair among themselves and concealed their private conversation"}},{"ar":"نَزَّاعَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"stripping away","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":16,"p":1,"ar":["نَزَّاعَةً","لِّلشَّوَىٰ"],"en":"A remover of exteriors"}},{"ar":"نَّٰزِعَٰت","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"those who pull out","word":null,"ex":{"s":79,"a":1,"p":1,"ar":["وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ","غَرْقًا"],"en":"By those [angels] who extract with violence"}},{"ar":"يُنَٰزِعُ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"to dispute with","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":67,"p":8,"ar":["لِّكُلِّ","أُمَّةٍ","جَعَلْنَا","مَنسَكًا","هُمْ","نَاسِكُوهُ ۖ","فَلَا","يُنَـٰزِعُنَّكَ","فِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ ۚ","وَٱدْعُ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ ۖ","إِنَّكَ","لَعَلَىٰ","هُدًى","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"en":"For every religion We have appointed rites which they perform. So, [O Muhammad], let the disbelievers not contend with you over the matter but invite them to your Lord. Indeed, you are upon straight guidance"}}],"surahs":[[7,3],[3,2],[8,2],[4,1],[11,1],[15,1],[18,1],[19,1],[20,1],[22,1],[26,1],[28,1],[52,1],[54,1],[70,1],[79,1]]}